ers a chance to form melds.\\nReason: Discarding J1 removes a single honor tile that is not part of any potential meld, simplifying the hand and reducing the risk of others completing their hands. This move keeps the focus on potential melds in suited tiles.\\nAnswer: Play J1\"}"}
